Facade: `agent` / `ask<T>` / `model` / `phase` / `log` / `report` /
`publishArtifact` / `channel` / `future` / `world` (`run`, `read`) /
`files` (`glob`, `read`, `grep`) / `git` (`changedFiles`, `diff`, `status`,
`log`) / `args` / `hole`.

